# Phase 11 Production Baseline (FROZEN)

Phase 11 is **production certified and frozen** at engine version **`PHASE11_ENGINE_VERSION = v1.1.0`**.

Treat the current implementation as the regression baseline. **Do not change Phase 11 hesitation / escalation / NIAT logic** without an explicit freeze waiver. Phase 12 may only use the approved non-escalate handoff target.

## Freeze contract

### Final Decision Hesitation

- Deterministic engine + dedicated taxonomy (not Phase 7)
- Personalized confidence reply → one confirm → optional second clarification
- Fast path when no hesitation
- Non-escalate exit → Phase 12 (`phase_12_personalized_counseling_recommendation`) — handoff only

### One-on-One escalation (hesitation funnel)

Escalate **only** for: repeated unresolved hesitation, multiple hesitations, repeated reassurance, or explicit expert request.  
**Never** escalate after the first objection alone. Optional only.  
URL only: `https://www.guidexpert.co.in/one-on-one-session`  
No WhatsApp booking, human handoff, ranking changes, or recommendation regeneration.

### NIAT interest funnel (separate)

Trigger only on **explicit** NIAT join / admission / apply / strong interest.  
Do **not** trigger on info questions or comparisons.  
Distinct narrative from hesitation escalation. Same official One-on-One URL.  
Analytics `source: niat_interest` (not `phase11_hesitation`).

## Guardrails (never)

Guarantee admissions/placements/salaries/scholarships; force booking; pressure; restart Phase 7; mutate recommendations/rankings/prior phase outputs; bypass deterministic routing; use LLMs for routing.

## Do not change unless

- Fixing a **verified bug** or **regression** against this baseline
- User explicitly requests a Phase 11 change with acknowledged freeze risk

## Frozen stage chain

```
… → phase_10_future_path_vision            (FROZEN v1.0.0)
  → phase_11_final_decision_hesitation     (FROZEN v1.1.0)
       ├─ → phase_12_personalized_counseling_recommendation  (handoff only)
       └─ → hesitation_escalation          (OOO URL; skips Phase 12)
  ↔ niat_interest_one_on_one               (FROZEN — parallel admission funnel; skips Phase 12)
```

